-   affine noetherian Hopf algebras satisfying a polynomial identity, ([\[xxsec6.2\]](#xxsec6.2){reference-type="ref" reference="xxsec6.2"});

-   enveloping algebras of finite dimensional Lie algebras, ([\[xxsec6.3\]](#xxsec6.3){reference-type="ref" reference="xxsec6.3"});

-   quantised enveloping algebras, ([\[xxsec6.4\]](#xxsec6.4)

